WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.090
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:08.360 --> 00:10.100
Yeniang is such a pain,

3
00:10.520 --> 00:12.050
making me fetch water for her.

4
00:14.470 --> 00:16.100
Hang in there, Duyao.

5
00:21.440 --> 00:22.490
His Lordship and the others are out?

6
00:47.660 --> 00:53.540
♪Winds rise. Youth fades. Joy and sorrow turn to nothing♪

7
00:55.580 --> 01:01.540
♪Blossoms fade away. This fleeting life is but a dream♪

8
01:02.580 --> 01:06.820
♪Desire blinds my eyes♪

9
01:10.500 --> 01:18.060
♪Our paths now part, and I cannot make you stay♪

10
01:18.420 --> 01:25.180
♪If love is deadly poison, hate is a furnace that sears the heart♪

11
01:26.420 --> 01:33.060
♪What is devotion? I fool my heart and spin my own cocoon♪

12
01:34.260 --> 01:41.100
♪Anger, obsession, greed, resentment, and envy bring trials across lifetimes♪

13
01:42.700 --> 01:49.220
♪The past turns to dust. I regret nothing, though my love was misplaced♪

14
01:53.980 --> 01:55.780
[Blossom in Darkness]

15
01:55.780 --> 01:57.780
[Based on the novel "Blossom in Darkness" by Guo Guo]

16
01:57.780 --> 02:00.780
[Episode 13]

17
02:06.390 --> 02:07.940
If Hua Changpu broke the sect's rules,

18
02:08.430 --> 02:09.560
why not just

19
02:09.560 --> 02:10.250
expel her?

20
02:10.390 --> 02:11.670
Why kill her so brutally?

21
02:12.480 --> 02:14.020
What Yan Shang did

22
02:14.480 --> 02:15.810
was clearly to settle a personal grudge.

23
02:16.670 --> 02:18.120
If Yan Shang was the one who killed

24
02:18.120 --> 02:18.900
Hua Changpu,

25
02:19.670 --> 02:21.410
why did she take revenge on Du Zhong?

26
02:22.640 --> 02:23.570
Because

27
02:25.270 --> 02:26.940
Du Zhong made

28
02:26.940 --> 02:28.390
her secret feelings public,

29
02:29.680 --> 02:31.100
leaving her

30
02:31.100 --> 02:32.390
with a ruined reputation

31
02:32.900 --> 02:34.280
and getting her killed.

32
02:34.670 --> 02:35.770
Yan Shang

33
02:36.310 --> 02:37.660
was truly despicable.

34
02:38.840 --> 02:41.100
Good thing he got what he deserved.

35
02:42.630 --> 02:43.660
What was he even trying to achieve?

36
02:49.520 --> 02:50.780
I... I'm sorry.

37
02:54.150 --> 02:55.660
Could a single curse from Hua Changpu

38
02:56.560 --> 02:58.010
really keep Du Zhong's wound

39
02:58.120 --> 02:59.220
from ever healing?

40
03:00.630 --> 03:01.290
Of course not.

41
03:01.520 --> 03:03.260
His inner demons must have taken root

42
03:03.430 --> 03:04.780
because of her words,

43
03:05.240 --> 03:06.980
weakening his faith in the immortal path

44
03:07.630 --> 03:08.500
and keeping him from ascending.

45
03:09.840 --> 03:10.340
That's why

46
03:10.710 --> 03:11.890
he keeps forcing

47
03:12.310 --> 03:13.170
those memories

48
03:13.470 --> 03:14.260
out of his body.

49
03:16.680 --> 03:17.660
The fragment you brought back

50
03:17.710 --> 03:18.500
has turned into a petal too,

51
03:19.000 --> 03:20.060
now that we're out of the dream.

52
03:20.360 --> 03:21.500
I can alter it slightly

53
03:22.430 --> 03:23.410
and create a false dream

54
03:25.280 --> 03:26.170
to make Du Zhong believe

55
03:26.560 --> 03:28.290
Hua Changpu never gravely wounded him.

56
03:28.630 --> 03:29.850
That will break his obsession.

57
03:30.310 --> 03:31.380
I'll go to him now.

58
03:31.710 --> 03:32.730
No. Not now.

59
03:36.360 --> 03:37.290
Right now,

60
03:37.560 --> 03:38.820
he and the other sect leaders

61
03:38.820 --> 03:39.840
are repairing the talisman.

62
03:40.360 --> 03:41.430
There'll still be time to reclaim

63
03:41.520 --> 03:43.010
your malice after it's been repaired.

64
03:43.030 --> 03:44.000
Then it'll be too late.

65
03:46.590 --> 03:48.080
Once he ascends to immortality,

66
03:48.360 --> 03:49.410
he'll leave the mortal world.

67
03:49.910 --> 03:50.860
Where would I find him then?

68
03:51.000 --> 03:51.610
I'll help you find him.

69
03:52.190 --> 03:52.570
You?

70
03:55.120 --> 03:56.850
What makes you so sure you can find him?

71
03:57.710 --> 03:58.410
Besides,

72
03:58.430 --> 03:59.540
the longer I stay here,

73
03:59.750 --> 04:00.670
the stronger

74
04:00.670 --> 04:01.660
the Wanjun Lock becomes.

75
04:02.470 --> 04:04.060
I have to get rid of him before it

76
04:04.470 --> 04:05.450
completely overpowers me.

77
04:07.400 --> 04:08.730
But Master's soul crystal

78
04:09.430 --> 04:10.730
is about to go completely dormant.

79
04:12.470 --> 04:13.340
I'm begging you.

80
04:13.680 --> 04:14.450
Help me one more time.

81
04:14.450 --> 04:15.610
I've already helped you once.

82
04:20.040 --> 04:21.050
Your problems matter,

83
04:22.070 --> 04:23.370
but mine don't?

84
04:28.830 --> 04:30.190
So even if I've forgotten everything

85
04:30.190 --> 04:31.490
from the past 1,000 years,

86
04:32.270 --> 04:33.370
I'll never forget

87
04:34.920 --> 04:36.900
all the pain and torment she put me through.

88
04:40.360 --> 04:41.460
There's nothing more to say to you.

89
04:42.270 --> 04:43.850
I'll get rid of him now.

90
04:44.430 --> 04:44.980
Qi Fengyin!

91
04:45.120 --> 04:45.660
Qi Fengyin!

92
04:45.950 --> 04:46.580
Qi Fengyin!

93
05:01.560 --> 05:02.220
Yuwen Hao?

94
05:02.800 --> 05:03.540
What are you doing here?

95
05:22.720 --> 05:24.020
While the succession trial is underway,

96
05:24.720 --> 05:26.370
we'd best avoid any contact.

97
05:26.560 --> 05:28.290
If you're here to test my abilities,

98
05:28.430 --> 05:29.290
I suggest

99
05:29.800 --> 05:30.700
you leave at once.

100
05:31.040 --> 05:32.020
You think everyone has

101
05:32.680 --> 05:33.660
the same motives as you.

102
05:34.870 --> 05:35.660
With that mindset,

103
05:36.560 --> 05:38.140
how could you lead Mount Zhaowu?

104
05:38.630 --> 05:39.730
What's wrong with my attitude?

105
05:40.510 --> 05:41.170
At least

106
05:41.270 --> 05:42.140
I'm honest and direct.

107
05:42.560 --> 05:43.340
You, on the other hand,

108
05:43.560 --> 05:45.170
pretend to be ascetic and righteous

109
05:45.630 --> 05:46.290
while secretly

110
05:46.720 --> 05:48.050
pining for that girl.

111
05:53.560 --> 05:54.220
What are you doing?

112
05:54.680 --> 05:56.020
It doesn't have my name on it.

113
05:56.830 --> 05:58.340
Report me if you like. I'll deny it.

114
05:59.270 --> 06:00.140
Soul Projection

115
06:01.310 --> 06:02.250
can cloud people's minds.

116
06:03.240 --> 06:04.020
It harms others

117
06:04.950 --> 06:06.140
and you too.

118
06:06.830 --> 06:07.730
Don't use it again.

119
06:16.480 --> 06:18.540
You came all this way to accuse me,

120
06:19.160 --> 06:20.370
then destroyed the evidence.

121
06:20.600 --> 06:21.700
What exactly do you want?

122
06:22.310 --> 06:23.220
I've made a decision.

123
06:24.720 --> 06:26.220
I'll let you be the next sect leader.

124
06:29.160 --> 06:29.780
Let me?

125
06:31.390 --> 06:32.700
The trial hasn't even

126
06:32.750 --> 06:33.780
produced a winner yet.

127
06:34.240 --> 06:35.050
What do you mean, "let me"?

128
06:35.360 --> 06:36.410
I'm letting you become sect leader

129
06:37.070 --> 06:38.850
not because you're more suited to it.

130
06:39.600 --> 06:40.370
In fact,

131
06:41.160 --> 06:43.220
with your current temperament and abilities,

132
06:43.360 --> 06:44.290
you're not fit for the role.

133
06:45.120 --> 06:46.660
There's simply no better candidate.

134
06:47.070 --> 06:48.250
I'll make do for now,

135
06:49.040 --> 06:50.340
but I won't let you do as you please.

136
06:50.950 --> 06:52.290
What nonsense are you spouting?

137
06:54.270 --> 06:55.410
You talk as if you've made

138
06:55.510 --> 06:56.700
that Hollow Fruit

139
06:56.800 --> 06:57.610
sprout

140
06:58.190 --> 06:59.610
and been named sect...

141
07:22.680 --> 07:23.780
Could Yuwen Hao

142
07:24.310 --> 07:25.980
really be giving up on the trial?

143
07:34.270 --> 07:35.140
Yamao?

144
07:38.680 --> 07:39.730
I'll see for myself

145
07:40.600 --> 07:41.610
how this girl has managed

146
07:41.630 --> 07:42.700
to bewitch Yuwen Hao

147
07:43.480 --> 07:44.340
and whether the two of them

148
07:44.360 --> 07:45.700
have been conspiring to trick me.

149
07:49.680 --> 07:50.220
Qi Fengyin,

150
07:51.160 --> 07:52.390
I know making the mystical flower bloom

151
07:52.390 --> 07:53.470
is all you live for.

152
07:53.560 --> 07:54.470
Qi Fengyin?

153
07:54.470 --> 07:55.250
All I'm asking

154
07:55.480 --> 07:56.860
is that you give me two more days.

155
07:56.860 --> 07:57.580
I promise,

156
07:58.390 --> 07:59.460
even if I have to risk my life,

157
07:59.950 --> 08:00.850
I'll help you

158
08:00.870 --> 08:01.580
reclaim your malice.

159
08:14.360 --> 08:15.290
Qi Fengyin is still alive?

160
08:18.920 --> 08:19.900
When did he get here?

161
08:20.070 --> 08:20.840
He already knows

162
08:20.840 --> 08:22.140
who I really am.

163
08:23.270 --> 08:23.840
You...

164
08:24.120 --> 08:25.490
The succession assembly is about to begin.

165
08:25.950 --> 08:27.340
If you kill me now,

166
08:28.000 --> 08:29.610
you won't be able to stay on Mount Zhaowu.

167
08:30.120 --> 08:31.730
Master and others from the Five Great Sects

168
08:32.200 --> 08:33.530
will notice I'm missing right away.

169
08:33.910 --> 08:35.340
They'll investigate

170
08:35.630 --> 08:36.490
and search for me.

171
08:38.390 --> 08:39.730
What do you want to do with him?

172
08:41.360 --> 08:41.650
You...

173
08:42.320 --> 08:43.130
You're not killing him?

174
08:44.870 --> 08:45.890
He has a point.

175
08:46.480 --> 08:47.580
Killing him now

176
08:48.320 --> 08:49.610
would only cause you trouble.

177
08:49.720 --> 08:50.770
But weren't you about to...?

178
08:53.630 --> 08:54.580
You'll wait for me?

179
08:56.150 --> 08:57.250
So you really are working

180
08:57.270 --> 08:57.850
with Qi Fengyin.

181
08:58.360 --> 08:59.770
You pretended to kill him,

182
09:00.240 --> 09:01.610
but you've been in league with him

183
09:01.790 --> 09:02.460
and betrayed the immortal sects!

184
09:04.320 --> 09:05.580
How about we make a deal?

185
09:06.550 --> 09:07.730
I've come to Mount Zhaowu

186
09:08.240 --> 09:09.530
only to save my master's life.

187
09:09.720 --> 09:11.100
Once he's saved, I'll leave.

188
09:11.630 --> 09:12.890
I can keep you alive.

189
09:13.390 --> 09:14.100
But if

190
09:14.840 --> 09:16.340
you tell anyone what you saw today,

191
09:17.030 --> 09:18.100
I have countless ways

192
09:18.440 --> 09:19.700
to make you wish you were dead.

193
09:35.270 --> 09:36.300
If we're making a deal,

194
09:37.870 --> 09:38.580
what I'm getting

195
09:39.030 --> 09:39.820
hardly compares

196
09:40.270 --> 09:41.100
to what you're getting,

197
09:42.080 --> 09:43.370
unless you agree to one more thing.

198
09:45.390 --> 09:45.940
Name it.

199
09:46.510 --> 09:47.250
Yuwen Hao

200
09:47.790 --> 09:49.180
has given up on the succession trial.

201
09:50.000 --> 09:50.490
He's given me

202
09:50.510 --> 09:51.490
his Hollow Bodhi Fruit,

203
09:51.510 --> 09:52.060
which has sprouted.

204
09:52.510 --> 09:53.730
But I don't trust him.

205
09:56.960 --> 09:58.100
You must make sure

206
09:59.240 --> 10:00.890
he loses to me

207
10:01.240 --> 10:02.010
at the succession assembly.

208
10:16.670 --> 10:17.340
Hao,

209
10:18.510 --> 10:20.410
I heard you'd be stepping aside to let someone else

210
10:20.410 --> 10:21.100
become sect leader.

211
10:21.240 --> 10:21.890
Is that true?

212
10:33.120 --> 10:34.370
Are you being forced into this?

213
10:37.240 --> 10:37.980
Don't overthink it.

214
10:40.120 --> 10:41.420
I just don't want to be sect leader.

215
10:46.000 --> 10:47.250
As long as no one's forcing you.

216
10:53.600 --> 10:54.460
If you don't want to tell me,

217
10:54.960 --> 10:56.220
you must have your reasons.

218
10:56.910 --> 10:58.180
I won't press you.

219
11:00.600 --> 11:01.460
But Hao,

220
11:04.480 --> 11:05.650
whatever you decide,

221
11:06.510 --> 11:07.340
I'll support you.

222
11:12.320 --> 11:13.220
You said it yourself.

223
11:14.910 --> 11:15.820
Whatever I decide.

224
11:20.360 --> 11:21.460
Then you can't take it back.

225
11:32.720 --> 11:34.220
Hurry! The assembly is about to start!

226
11:36.360 --> 11:37.180
Candidates

227
11:37.270 --> 11:38.820
for leader of Mount Zhaowu, step forward.

228
12:18.080 --> 12:18.850
Here's the rule

229
12:18.910 --> 12:21.010
for choosing Mount Zhaowu's next leader:

230
12:21.720 --> 12:23.340
whoever makes a Hollow Fruit sprout

231
12:23.750 --> 12:25.770
will become Mount Zhaowu's next leader.

232
12:26.550 --> 12:27.180
Both candidates,

233
12:27.200 --> 12:28.820
please present your Hollow Fruits.

234
12:29.440 --> 12:30.340
Let our master,

235
12:30.750 --> 12:31.580
the other sect leaders,

236
12:32.120 --> 12:33.130
and all our fellow disciples

237
12:33.320 --> 12:34.220
bear witness.

238
12:40.390 --> 12:41.250
That's Zhiwei for you!

239
12:41.750 --> 12:42.730
It's really sprouted!

240
12:43.630 --> 12:44.980
I didn't expect this!

241
12:45.670 --> 12:46.650
That's Zhiwei for you!

242
12:51.150 --> 12:51.850
Who'd have thought?

243
12:51.960 --> 12:53.060
The fruit of the Heartless Tree

244
12:53.240 --> 12:54.420
really can sprout.

245
12:55.200 --> 12:57.010
And to think it wasn't

246
12:57.440 --> 12:58.670
your chief disciple, Yuwen Hao,

247
12:58.670 --> 12:59.340
who did it.

248
13:01.240 --> 13:01.940
Yuwen Hao,

249
13:03.000 --> 13:03.650
where's yours?

250
13:11.750 --> 13:13.300
Even if you haven't managed it, Hao,

251
13:13.600 --> 13:14.370
that's all right.

252
13:15.080 --> 13:16.460
I'm sure no one here

253
13:16.550 --> 13:17.610
would laugh at you.

254
13:28.750 --> 13:29.580
How is that possible?

255
13:29.630 --> 13:30.730
How could Hao's fruit not have sprouted?

256
13:33.150 --> 13:34.130
That can't be right.

257
13:34.580 --> 13:35.530
What happens now?

258
13:42.530 --> 13:43.490
Look!

259
13:47.750 --> 13:48.850
That's Hao for you!

260
13:58.440 --> 13:59.940
Yuwen Hao has done it too, as expected.

261
14:00.390 --> 14:01.010
But

262
14:01.550 --> 14:03.220
Zhiwei's is growing a little better.

263
14:03.600 --> 14:05.250
Hao is our chief disciple, after all.

264
14:05.600 --> 14:06.890
It's no surprise he managed it.

265
14:07.790 --> 14:09.220
Still, judging by their growth,

266
14:09.550 --> 14:10.730
he's lost to me.

267
14:12.550 --> 14:13.650
This is tricky.

268
14:14.960 --> 14:16.100
I said

269
14:16.900 --> 14:19.100
whoever could make a Hollow Fruit sprout

270
14:19.550 --> 14:21.370
would be Mount Zhaowu's next leader.

271
14:22.370 --> 14:23.220
I never said

272
14:23.870 --> 14:24.980
size would decide the winner.

273
14:26.510 --> 14:28.060
Since you've both succeeded,

274
14:29.360 --> 14:29.940
I'll declare

275
14:30.600 --> 14:31.650
a tie.

276
14:32.320 --> 14:32.980
Master,

277
14:33.270 --> 14:34.300
how can this be a tie?

278
14:35.750 --> 14:36.460
Master,

279
14:38.000 --> 14:38.580
the tree

280
14:39.670 --> 14:40.490
is called the Heartless Tree.

281
14:46.080 --> 14:46.650
The fruit

282
14:48.200 --> 14:49.060
is called the Hollow Fruit.

283
14:50.270 --> 14:51.580
Both names suggest

284
14:51.720 --> 14:52.220
something

285
14:52.960 --> 14:53.820
close to nothingness,

286
14:54.440 --> 14:55.300
but not nothingness itself.

287
14:56.550 --> 14:57.530
To be heartless is to sever bonds,

288
14:58.080 --> 14:59.530
and to be hollow is to be emptied of all substance.

289
15:00.670 --> 15:01.850
If we reverse that process, we'll see

290
15:02.960 --> 15:04.220
that all things in the world arise from being,

291
15:05.440 --> 15:07.850
and being arises from nonbeing.

292
15:48.000 --> 15:48.650
Very good.

293
15:49.750 --> 15:50.250
Hao,

294
15:51.510 --> 15:52.610
you've attained enlightenment.

295
16:10.210 --> 16:10.770
Master,

296
16:11.570 --> 16:12.890
I have something important to report.

297
16:15.120 --> 16:16.220
He wants to expose Qi Fengyin.

298
16:16.790 --> 16:18.180
Even if I ruin the assembly,

299
16:18.390 --> 16:19.370
I can't let him speak.

300
16:19.840 --> 16:21.040
I have to buy as much time as I can.

301
16:21.040 --> 16:21.940
Master...

302
16:28.600 --> 16:29.180
Master,

303
16:30.720 --> 16:31.700
Zhiwei has fainted.

304
16:34.360 --> 16:34.940
Master,

305
16:35.440 --> 16:36.300
Zhiwei

306
16:36.320 --> 16:37.420
must have exhausted himself

307
16:37.720 --> 16:38.820
during the trial.

308
16:39.080 --> 16:40.420
And losing to Hao just now must have

309
16:40.630 --> 16:41.650
briefly disrupted his circulation.

310
16:42.390 --> 16:44.460
He needs some quiet rest.

311
16:45.080 --> 16:46.300
Have him taken away to rest.

312
16:46.790 --> 16:47.180
Yes.

313
16:57.030 --> 16:57.770
The next leader

314
16:58.270 --> 17:00.100
of Mount Zhaowu has been chosen.

315
17:02.240 --> 17:03.010
Yuwen Hao,

316
17:03.600 --> 17:04.330
step forward.

317
17:19.200 --> 17:20.010
As of today,

318
17:20.750 --> 17:21.250
I

319
17:21.590 --> 17:24.050
will step down as leader of Mount Zhaowu.

320
17:24.400 --> 17:25.180
My successor

321
17:25.960 --> 17:26.730
will be Yuwen Hao.

322
17:35.070 --> 17:36.770
Congratulations, Master Yuwen.

323
17:37.070 --> 17:38.770
Congratulations, Master Yuwen.

324
17:39.640 --> 17:41.730
Congratulations, Master Yuwen!

325
18:06.920 --> 18:07.940
So you really are working

326
18:08.000 --> 18:08.700
with Qi Fengyin.

327
18:08.920 --> 18:10.380
You've been in league with him

328
18:10.590 --> 18:11.290
and betrayed the immortal sects!

329
18:12.400 --> 18:13.860
How about we make a deal?

330
18:14.030 --> 18:15.290
Unless you agree to one more thing.

331
18:16.400 --> 18:17.730
So Qi Fengyin is still alive.

332
18:18.550 --> 18:19.810
Yamao lied to everyone.

333
18:20.960 --> 18:22.810
I heard you'd be stepping aside to let someone else

334
18:22.830 --> 18:23.490
become sect leader.

335
18:23.680 --> 18:24.330
Is that true?

336
18:25.440 --> 18:26.380
Whatever you decide,

337
18:27.440 --> 18:28.250
I'll support you.

338
18:34.440 --> 18:35.620
Only as sect leader

339
18:36.240 --> 18:37.330
can I keep you safe.

340
18:52.240 --> 18:52.900
Hao.

341
18:54.920 --> 18:55.730
Congratulations

342
18:55.960 --> 18:57.090
on becoming the next sect leader.

343
18:57.480 --> 18:58.180
I always knew

344
18:58.550 --> 18:59.900
you'd win the trial.

345
19:00.790 --> 19:01.490
I appreciate that.

346
19:03.160 --> 19:05.010
You seemed so uninterested before.

347
19:05.270 --> 19:06.660
I was worried you'd give up.

348
19:07.310 --> 19:08.620
Thankfully, at the last moment,

349
19:09.030 --> 19:09.810
you came to your senses.

350
19:10.110 --> 19:10.530
Yinhua,

351
19:11.550 --> 19:12.530
I have something important to do.

352
19:13.160 --> 19:13.860
Let's talk

353
19:14.310 --> 19:15.220
about this later.

354
19:18.110 --> 19:19.530
Zhiwei fainted just now,

355
19:19.830 --> 19:20.570
but from what I saw,

356
19:20.640 --> 19:21.660
poor circulation wasn't the cause.

357
19:22.000 --> 19:22.700
Did something

358
19:22.960 --> 19:24.180
happen between you two?

359
19:31.480 --> 19:32.250
You're overthinking it.

360
19:37.880 --> 19:39.320
It was clearly Hao who secretly knocked

361
19:39.320 --> 19:40.110
Zhiwei out.

362
19:40.680 --> 19:41.700
Why did he do that?

363
19:42.960 --> 19:43.460
Hao,

364
19:44.000 --> 19:45.220
what are you hiding?

365
20:06.920 --> 20:07.460
Qi Fengyin,

366
20:07.720 --> 20:08.620
you really are still alive.

367
20:10.160 --> 20:11.180
Don't hurt my brother!

368
20:11.750 --> 20:12.460
Miss Duyao,

369
20:13.240 --> 20:14.010
what are you doing here?

370
20:15.350 --> 20:16.420
Do you know who he is?

371
20:16.480 --> 20:17.010
Duyao,

372
20:17.590 --> 20:18.730
this doesn't concern you.

373
20:19.160 --> 20:19.700
Step back.

374
20:20.240 --> 20:21.140
He wants to kill you,

375
20:21.550 --> 20:22.460
so I'll kill him first!

376
20:22.590 --> 20:23.010
Duyao!

377
20:27.880 --> 20:29.010
Please put your sword away, Hao.

378
20:29.310 --> 20:30.180
I can explain

379
20:30.640 --> 20:31.660
everything to you.

380
20:32.000 --> 20:32.980
What is there to explain?

381
20:33.750 --> 20:35.220
I see you're still as crazy as ever.

382
20:35.790 --> 20:36.700
How dare you deceive

383
20:36.720 --> 20:37.660
the immortal sects with Qi Fengyin?

384
20:38.200 --> 20:39.520
Do you understand the consequences?

385
20:40.480 --> 20:41.290
If I hadn't done that,

386
20:42.640 --> 20:43.540
would any of you have agreed

387
20:43.540 --> 20:44.380
to help me save my master?

388
20:48.590 --> 20:49.810
It's not too late to put things right.

389
20:51.160 --> 20:51.910
Let me kill him.

390
20:52.440 --> 20:53.330
You're welcome to try.

391
20:55.640 --> 20:56.980
The one you should be worrying about

392
20:58.550 --> 20:59.660
is your master, Du Zhong.

393
21:02.030 --> 21:02.980
Your master is carrying

394
21:03.000 --> 21:04.050
a wisp of my malice.

395
21:05.640 --> 21:06.220
What did you say?

396
21:07.350 --> 21:08.010
Hao,

397
21:08.960 --> 21:10.180
you met Xiangyuan.

398
21:10.790 --> 21:11.700
You should know

399
21:12.400 --> 21:13.600
malice attaches itself

400
21:13.600 --> 21:14.860
to those consumed by obsession.

401
21:15.400 --> 21:16.490
If we don't remove it in time,

402
21:16.880 --> 21:19.050
Uncle Du could make a terrible mistake.

403
21:19.920 --> 21:20.530
Nonsense.

404
21:22.830 --> 21:23.700
You won't fool me again.

405
21:24.270 --> 21:25.530
If you don't trust me at all,

406
21:26.680 --> 21:27.900
why did you knock Zhiwei out

407
21:28.640 --> 21:29.940
at the assembly just now

408
21:30.350 --> 21:31.010
to cover for me?

409
21:33.920 --> 21:35.050
My master is a man of integrity.

410
21:35.750 --> 21:36.860
He's about to ascend.

411
21:38.680 --> 21:39.770
How could he be carrying malice?

412
21:40.160 --> 21:41.700
Why not ask him yourself?

413
21:45.750 --> 21:47.140
I know it's hard for you to believe.

414
21:48.070 --> 21:49.460
But just wait until he's finished

415
21:50.000 --> 21:51.090
repairing the talisman.

416
21:52.680 --> 21:54.140
Then I'll help you get to the bottom of this.

417
21:54.830 --> 21:55.460
Impossible...

418
21:56.590 --> 21:57.330
I don't believe Master

419
21:57.350 --> 21:58.250
could be carrying malice.

420
21:58.920 --> 21:59.570
Hao!

421
21:59.880 --> 22:00.570
I'll stop him!

422
22:02.790 --> 22:03.180
But he...

423
22:04.920 --> 22:05.660
There's no point arguing.

424
22:06.200 --> 22:07.700
If he wanted to expose Qi Fengyin,

425
22:08.110 --> 22:09.380
he could've done it

426
22:10.160 --> 22:11.380
at the assembly.

427
22:11.920 --> 22:12.650
He only came here

428
22:12.880 --> 22:14.090
to get some answers.

429
22:14.480 --> 22:15.380
But what do we do

430
22:15.440 --> 22:16.630
if he goes to Du Zhong

431
22:16.630 --> 22:17.250
and confronts him?

432
22:17.750 --> 22:19.380
Hao is mature and levelheaded.

433
22:20.000 --> 22:21.220
He wouldn't do that.

434
22:31.350 --> 22:32.250
Don't worry about me.

435
22:33.030 --> 22:34.180
Until you find the talisman,

436
22:34.920 --> 22:36.050
I'll stay here

437
22:36.510 --> 22:37.180
and keep out of sight.

438
22:37.510 --> 22:38.490
Then I'll stand guard here.

439
22:38.830 --> 22:39.400
If anyone comes...

440
22:39.400 --> 22:40.660
You and Youyou will keep watch here.

441
22:41.240 --> 22:42.090
If anyone comes,

442
22:42.440 --> 22:43.460
quietly lead them away.

443
22:43.830 --> 22:44.620
Don't draw attention.

444
22:44.830 --> 22:45.330
Understood?

445
22:48.550 --> 22:49.810
Are you worried about Yuwen Hao?

446
22:53.680 --> 22:55.140
He owes Du Zhong so much.

447
22:55.830 --> 22:56.900
The truth

448
22:57.960 --> 22:59.460
will be too painful for him to bear.

449
23:01.030 --> 23:02.250
But he'll find out sooner or later.

450
23:24.480 --> 23:25.290
Miss Yamao,

451
23:26.070 --> 23:26.980
how long have you been here?

452
23:27.920 --> 23:28.840
Have you been so worried

453
23:28.840 --> 23:29.900
about whether we'll succeed today

454
23:30.160 --> 23:31.050
that you haven't rested at all?

455
23:33.350 --> 23:33.980
I...

456
23:34.880 --> 23:36.090
Don't worry so much.

457
23:36.510 --> 23:38.730
High Immortal Danshen will return safely.

458
23:41.550 --> 23:42.530
Thank you both.

459
24:57.350 --> 24:58.090
What do you want?

460
24:58.720 --> 24:59.700
Did Yuwen Hao send you?

461
25:00.350 --> 25:01.700
You didn't pass out at the assembly

462
25:02.110 --> 25:03.530
from the shock

463
25:03.590 --> 25:04.220
of losing,

464
25:04.350 --> 25:04.810
did you?

465
25:09.310 --> 25:10.530
No one else noticed,

466
25:11.590 --> 25:12.620
but I saw

467
25:13.510 --> 25:14.620
Hao

468
25:15.590 --> 25:16.770
secretly cast a spell.

469
25:21.790 --> 25:23.080
You've always followed Yuwen Hao

470
25:23.080 --> 25:24.040
without question.

471
25:24.960 --> 25:26.730
What are you plotting with him now?

472
25:27.400 --> 25:28.700
What are you trying to pull this time?

473
25:29.640 --> 25:31.940
Hao is kind and honest.

474
25:32.270 --> 25:33.420
He's easily taken advantage of.

475
25:34.880 --> 25:35.700
I'm not here

476
25:36.550 --> 25:38.010
to get you out of trouble.

477
25:39.400 --> 25:40.570
I'm here to save him.

478
25:44.680 --> 25:46.340
What exactly happened between you two?

479
25:47.400 --> 25:48.340
At the assembly,

480
25:48.340 --> 25:49.430
why did he knock you out?

481
25:51.400 --> 25:52.050
Yuwen Hao

482
25:52.070 --> 25:53.810
is shielding Yamao, a traitor to the immortal sects.

483
25:54.880 --> 25:55.810
He's conspiring with her

484
25:56.440 --> 25:57.900
to deceive everyone in the Five Great Sects.

485
25:59.400 --> 26:00.420
He's harboring

486
26:00.920 --> 26:02.900
the devil Qi Fengyin here on Mount Zhaowu.

487
26:06.350 --> 26:08.050
Is that what you call

488
26:08.350 --> 26:09.660
being kind and honest?

489
26:16.720 --> 26:18.450
How much longer do we have to stay

490
26:18.450 --> 26:19.730
on Mount Zhaowu?

491
26:20.400 --> 26:21.820
This place is so dull.

492
26:21.880 --> 26:23.440
I can't stand another moment here.

493
26:23.720 --> 26:24.460
There's nothing good to eat

494
26:24.470 --> 26:25.490
and nothing fun to do.

495
26:25.880 --> 26:27.570
We have to hide and sneak around every day,

496
26:27.750 --> 26:28.620
always on edge.

497
26:29.510 --> 26:30.490
By the end of today,

498
26:31.110 --> 26:32.090
everything

499
26:32.160 --> 26:33.090
should be settled.

500
26:34.650 --> 26:35.180
Oh, right.

501
26:35.510 --> 26:36.870
I hear the immortal sects

502
26:36.870 --> 26:38.870
hunt rare beasts and gather mystical plants

503
26:38.870 --> 26:39.610
for their meals.

504
26:39.640 --> 26:40.660
Eating them boosts your cultivation.

505
26:40.750 --> 26:41.660
See if you can find

506
26:41.750 --> 26:42.700
anything good to eat.

507
26:42.830 --> 26:43.780
As long as His Lordship didn't cook it,

508
26:43.780 --> 26:44.390
anything's fine.

509
26:44.720 --> 26:45.140
All right.

510
27:17.720 --> 27:18.250
Duyao!

511
27:18.880 --> 27:19.980
What did you eat?

512
27:20.880 --> 27:21.660
What happened?

513
27:25.590 --> 27:26.620
Come on, wake up!

514
27:31.270 --> 27:32.140
Good. She's still alive.

515
27:34.240 --> 27:34.860
My Lord.

516
27:35.310 --> 27:36.050
What happened?

517
27:36.400 --> 27:37.660
I asked her

518
27:37.720 --> 27:38.770
to help me find

519
27:38.830 --> 27:40.490
food that would boost my cultivation.

520
27:41.000 --> 27:42.290
She had one mouthful of this porridge

521
27:42.310 --> 27:43.010
and passed out.

522
27:43.960 --> 27:44.660
If I'd known,

523
27:44.720 --> 27:46.330
I wouldn't have thought of eating their food.

524
27:47.350 --> 27:48.250
This is Soul-Soothing Porridge.

525
27:48.790 --> 27:49.290
Yeniang made it

526
27:49.310 --> 27:50.490
especially for Du Zhong.

527
27:51.270 --> 27:52.180
Then why did she

528
27:52.550 --> 27:54.330
drug Du Zhong's porridge?

529
27:55.400 --> 27:56.130
I may have

530
27:56.130 --> 27:57.280
missed something.

531
27:58.310 --> 27:58.980
Stay here

532
27:59.440 --> 28:00.220
and watch over Duyao.

533
28:00.590 --> 28:01.530
Wait, My Lord.

534
28:01.590 --> 28:03.200
Yuwen Hao has broken your disguise spell.

535
28:03.400 --> 28:04.490
If you go now,

536
28:04.490 --> 28:05.090
you'll be in danger.

537
28:06.000 --> 28:06.940
I'm going to find Yeniang.

538
28:19.960 --> 28:21.650
You're Qi from the kitchen.

539
28:22.350 --> 28:24.050
What's in your basket?

540
28:27.200 --> 28:29.530
Just medicinal porridge for Master Du.

541
28:33.030 --> 28:33.380
You...!

542
28:39.550 --> 28:40.860
No wonder you always return

543
28:40.920 --> 28:42.180
to Qingjing Grove

544
28:42.440 --> 28:44.050
after delivering Du Zhong's Soul-Soothing Porridge.

545
28:44.400 --> 28:45.330
You've been stealing

546
28:45.350 --> 28:46.900
these petals formed from his obsession.

547
28:47.240 --> 28:48.810
I've known for some time

548
28:49.110 --> 28:50.980
that you're no ordinary kitchen helper.

549
28:51.400 --> 28:52.860
I've kept quiet

550
28:53.110 --> 28:54.730
about everything you've done.

551
28:55.110 --> 28:57.250
Why don't we do each other a favor?

552
29:03.350 --> 29:04.570
You return to Qingjing Grove

553
29:04.640 --> 29:05.660
after Du Zhong falls asleep.

554
29:06.400 --> 29:07.770
No one opens the barrier for you,

555
29:08.590 --> 29:10.180
and you can't use immortal techniques.

556
29:10.920 --> 29:11.770
How do you get in?

557
29:12.400 --> 29:13.350
As far as I know,

558
29:13.350 --> 29:14.730
Qingjing Grove was

559
29:14.730 --> 29:15.490
Hua Changpu's only home.

560
29:16.070 --> 29:16.980
No one but Du Zhong

561
29:16.980 --> 29:18.410
could come and go there freely.

562
29:18.960 --> 29:20.050
Then Yan Shang

563
29:20.050 --> 29:21.570
broke Hua Changpu's legs

564
29:22.310 --> 29:23.330
and disfigured half her face.

565
29:24.310 --> 29:26.050
You're scarred on that very same side.

566
29:28.750 --> 29:29.900
You're Yeniang,

567
29:30.510 --> 29:31.860
but you're also Hua Changpu.

568
29:40.680 --> 29:41.770
I never imagined

569
29:43.000 --> 29:44.860
that even in this state,

570
29:46.070 --> 29:47.620
someone would still recognize me

571
29:48.480 --> 29:50.090
as Hua Changpu.

572
29:50.750 --> 29:51.810
You really are Hua Changpu.

573
29:54.030 --> 29:55.180
A hundred years ago, Du Zhong

574
29:55.200 --> 29:56.490
failed to kill me

575
29:56.880 --> 29:58.860
but left me living like a ghost.

576
29:59.750 --> 30:01.180
If I don't destroy him,

577
30:01.720 --> 30:03.460
how can I live with myself?

578
30:04.270 --> 30:06.010
But Yan Shang was the one who tried to kill you.

579
30:06.160 --> 30:07.660
So you believe it was Yan Shang too?

580
30:10.550 --> 30:11.620
Ah, Du Zhong.

581
30:12.310 --> 30:13.730
So noble, so saintly.

582
30:14.160 --> 30:15.700
Everyone else is to blame:

583
30:16.030 --> 30:17.090
Yan Shang, for protecting

584
30:17.110 --> 30:18.660
the sect's good name,

585
30:19.110 --> 30:20.980
and me, for loving Du Zhong.

586
30:21.830 --> 30:22.700
But what about him?

587
30:23.480 --> 30:24.660
Has he really done

588
30:24.660 --> 30:25.330
nothing wrong?

589
30:35.070 --> 30:36.180
Aside from immortality,

590
30:37.270 --> 30:37.900
isn't there

591
30:38.110 --> 30:40.010
anything else that matters to you?

592
30:40.510 --> 30:41.420
My mind is made up.

593
31:12.720 --> 31:13.460
You spend all day

594
31:13.720 --> 31:15.140
catching birds and fish.

595
31:15.830 --> 31:18.090
When will you make progress in your studies?

596
32:00.400 --> 32:00.980
Master,

597
32:03.000 --> 32:04.770
could you stop following the Path of Detachment?

598
32:15.510 --> 32:16.220
Master,

599
32:17.000 --> 32:17.860
there's no place on Mount Zhaowu

600
32:17.860 --> 32:18.980
for a woman like Hua Changpu.

601
32:19.340 --> 32:21.220
You follow the Path of Detachment.

602
32:21.720 --> 32:22.570
When passion stirs,

603
32:22.960 --> 32:23.810
you're in unbearable pain.

604
32:24.480 --> 32:25.330
Others may not see it,

605
32:26.240 --> 32:27.180
but I've followed you the longest.

606
32:27.680 --> 32:28.770
How could I not notice?

607
32:29.310 --> 32:30.140
My affairs

608
32:30.750 --> 32:31.900
are no one else's concern.

609
32:32.920 --> 32:33.420
Leave.

610
32:33.790 --> 32:35.460
Master, would you really give up

611
32:36.160 --> 32:37.140
the Path of Detachment for her?

612
32:42.200 --> 32:43.860
I've devoted my life to cultivation.

613
32:44.510 --> 32:46.770
I'm just one step from ascending to immortality.

614
32:47.440 --> 32:48.900
Why would I give it up for anyone?

615
32:49.070 --> 32:50.660
But Hua Changpu does all she can to bewitch you.

616
32:51.240 --> 32:52.810
Aren't you afraid she'll ruin

617
32:53.110 --> 32:54.250
your lifetime of cultivation?

618
33:09.070 --> 33:10.290
Why not expel her from the sect?

619
33:11.440 --> 33:12.620
Since she wants love,

620
33:13.160 --> 33:14.530
let her marry

621
33:14.530 --> 33:15.180
another man.

622
33:16.680 --> 33:17.330
Impossible!

623
33:20.310 --> 33:21.460
Expel her from the sect

624
33:22.070 --> 33:23.290
and let her marry

625
33:23.350 --> 33:24.090
another man?

626
33:24.240 --> 33:24.980
Absolutely not!

627
33:29.590 --> 33:31.250
In life and in death,

628
33:31.510 --> 33:32.900
she belongs to Mount Zhaowu.

629
33:33.310 --> 33:34.490
Whether at the ends of the world,

630
33:34.490 --> 33:35.380
in the heavens, or the underworld,

631
33:35.550 --> 33:37.530
she will always be my disciple!

632
33:40.160 --> 33:40.730
Master,

633
33:42.160 --> 33:42.460
you...

634
34:09.190 --> 34:10.420
Please let me rid you

635
34:12.190 --> 34:14.090
of the source of your inner demons.

636
34:31.320 --> 34:32.690
Inner demons...

637
35:23.630 --> 35:25.170
His Path of Detachment

638
35:25.960 --> 35:27.130
meant he couldn't love me.

639
35:28.070 --> 35:29.340
His own selfishness

640
35:29.920 --> 35:31.340
meant he wouldn't let me go.

641
35:32.630 --> 35:33.740
Only my death

642
35:34.150 --> 35:36.260
could wipe it all away.

643
35:37.150 --> 35:38.260
But I crawled back

644
35:38.320 --> 35:40.010
from the foot of that towering cliff.

645
35:41.440 --> 35:43.790
How could I let him get his wish?

646
35:47.920 --> 35:49.040
The Soul-Soothing Porridge

647
35:49.040 --> 35:50.500
you make with these petals

648
35:51.190 --> 35:53.650
seems to free Du Zhong from his inner demons,

649
35:54.760 --> 35:56.370
but it actually makes them

650
35:56.370 --> 35:57.490
take even deeper root.

651
35:58.960 --> 35:59.460
Yes.

652
36:01.030 --> 36:02.530
My face was ruined,

653
36:02.760 --> 36:04.130
and my powers destroyed.

654
36:04.670 --> 36:05.970
I've survived all these years as a wretched shell

655
36:05.970 --> 36:07.010
of my former self.

656
36:07.320 --> 36:09.210
I'm out to destroy his faith in the immortal path

657
36:09.880 --> 36:11.080
and his cultivation,

658
36:11.090 --> 36:11.980
what he treasures most.

659
36:13.880 --> 36:15.690
None of you can stop me.

660
36:17.880 --> 36:18.860
Qi Fengyin is up ahead!

661
36:19.360 --> 36:20.300
Don't let him escape again!

662
36:24.550 --> 36:26.090
Your own life is in danger.

663
36:26.630 --> 36:28.340
Stay out of other people's affairs.

664
36:48.070 --> 36:48.490
Youyou!

665
36:49.630 --> 36:50.170
Qingxing?

666
36:53.230 --> 36:54.460
How did you know we were here?

667
36:54.670 --> 36:55.980
All of Mount Zhaowu knows now

668
36:56.030 --> 36:56.900
that Qi Fengyin is still alive.

669
36:57.000 --> 36:58.130
Zhiwei has called on the disciples

670
36:58.190 --> 36:58.820
to hunt him down.

671
36:59.280 --> 37:00.210
Leave now, while you still can,

672
37:00.630 --> 37:01.940
or you won't get away.

673
37:04.880 --> 37:05.460
Qingxing,

674
37:05.590 --> 37:06.980
His Lordship has no powers now.

675
37:07.030 --> 37:08.210
If they capture him,

676
37:08.320 --> 37:09.170
he's finished.

677
37:09.710 --> 37:11.280
I swear His Lordship

678
37:11.280 --> 37:12.480
means Mount Zhaowu no harm.

679
37:12.510 --> 37:13.850
He only wants to reclaim

680
37:13.850 --> 37:14.940
his malice from Du Zhong.

681
37:15.000 --> 37:16.240
Help me save His Lordship.

682
37:16.880 --> 37:17.420
Please?

683
37:18.920 --> 37:19.690
I'm begging you!

684
37:22.920 --> 37:23.570
I can't help you.

685
37:24.190 --> 37:25.260
And I can't trust you.

686
37:25.880 --> 37:26.690
If you leave now,

687
37:26.920 --> 37:27.860
you can still get away alive.

688
37:28.480 --> 37:28.980
Otherwise,

689
37:29.190 --> 37:30.170
I'll have to obey Master's orders

690
37:30.440 --> 37:31.260
and capture you as his accomplice.

691
37:33.280 --> 37:33.780
Youyou,

692
37:34.190 --> 37:35.090
think twice.

693
37:36.880 --> 37:37.210
Qing...

694
37:38.630 --> 37:39.460
What do I do now?

695
37:46.840 --> 37:48.130
He has the Wanjun Lock on him.

696
37:48.480 --> 37:49.690
After all this time on Mount Zhaowu,

697
37:49.960 --> 37:51.610
his movements must be tightly restricted.

698
37:52.190 --> 37:52.860
Don't be afraid of him.

699
37:53.030 --> 37:53.460
Attack!

700
38:04.480 --> 38:05.210
Fellow disciples,

701
38:05.800 --> 38:07.380
if we slay Qi Fengyin today,

702
38:07.630 --> 38:08.650
we'll be famous throughout the world.

703
38:09.030 --> 38:10.130
Everyone, follow my orders.

704
38:10.360 --> 38:11.380
Strike from afar with sword energy!

705
38:11.670 --> 38:12.490
Form the sword hand seal!

706
38:47.510 --> 38:48.170
Master!

707
38:50.880 --> 38:51.650
Bad news!

708
38:52.070 --> 38:53.010
Qi Fengyin is still alive.

709
38:53.320 --> 38:54.820
He's hiding here on Mount Zhaowu.

710
39:00.400 --> 39:00.860
Yinhua,

711
39:01.190 --> 39:01.940
is that true?

712
39:02.230 --> 39:03.260
Are you sure it's Qi Fengyin?

713
39:07.760 --> 39:08.380
I...

714
39:20.840 --> 39:22.210
I... I don't know.

715
39:24.710 --> 39:25.530
Esteemed sect leaders,

716
39:25.590 --> 39:26.420
let's go and see for ourselves

717
39:26.760 --> 39:27.570
whether it's true.

718
39:28.000 --> 39:28.340
Let's go.

719
39:35.000 --> 39:35.860
If you want to save your master,

720
39:36.280 --> 39:37.260
stay out of this.

721
39:48.800 --> 39:49.490
My Lord.

722
39:50.110 --> 39:50.780
My Lord...

723
39:51.360 --> 39:52.130
Are you hurt?

724
39:52.360 --> 39:53.860
They'll catch up with us soon.

725
39:54.320 --> 39:55.980
Forget the malice for now.

726
39:56.550 --> 39:57.250
Run.

727
40:09.920 --> 40:10.980
It really is Qi Fengyin.

728
40:13.670 --> 40:14.860
Where can you run now?

729
40:26.150 --> 40:27.570
Since Qi Fengyin is still alive,

730
40:27.800 --> 40:29.120
what was all that talk

731
40:29.120 --> 40:29.910
about Miss Yamao

732
40:30.230 --> 40:31.320
slaying the devil?

733
40:36.360 --> 40:37.400
Clearly, Yamao

734
40:37.400 --> 40:38.860
has been conspiring with Qi Fengyin

735
40:39.070 --> 40:40.050
to deceive us all.

736
40:46.190 --> 40:47.130
If they find out

737
40:47.190 --> 40:48.740
I've been working with Qi Fengyin,

738
40:49.190 --> 40:50.380
our efforts will all go to waste,

739
40:50.920 --> 40:51.690
and I'll be...

740
40:52.320 --> 40:53.780
You're all so ridiculous.

741
40:57.550 --> 40:58.420
You actually thought

742
40:58.440 --> 40:59.690
a mere herb spirit

743
41:00.150 --> 41:01.610
could kill me so easily?

744
41:03.960 --> 41:05.300
I was simply tired

745
41:05.320 --> 41:06.210
of being chased,

746
41:07.360 --> 41:09.130
so I used her to fake my death.

747
41:11.030 --> 41:11.820
Qi Fengyin...

748
41:14.150 --> 41:15.980
Fooling an herb spirit is one thing.

749
41:16.150 --> 41:16.980
But I never thought

750
41:17.030 --> 41:18.300
the mighty Five Great Sects

751
41:19.510 --> 41:21.610
would fall for it so easily

752
41:22.960 --> 41:24.460
and let me toy with you.

753
41:25.800 --> 41:27.050
What a joke.

754
41:27.630 --> 41:28.170
You fiend.

755
41:29.070 --> 41:30.820
How dare you boast when you're about to die?

756
41:31.710 --> 41:34.130
He's bound by the Wanjun Lock now.

757
41:34.880 --> 41:36.900
We mustn't let this fiend escape today!

758
41:58.960 --> 41:59.940
Bind his hands!

759
42:09.510 --> 42:10.610
Qi Fengyin has denied

760
42:10.630 --> 42:11.490
we're working together.

761
42:12.070 --> 42:13.300
If I just hold back now,

762
42:13.630 --> 42:14.940
everything can go back to the way it was.

763
42:18.670 --> 42:19.690
Master will wake up,

764
42:20.280 --> 42:21.380
I'll still be part of the immortal sects,

765
42:21.880 --> 42:23.010
and I can return to Luoshen Valley.

766
42:34.960 --> 42:36.610
I'll just die again. So what?

767
42:48.510 --> 42:49.530
Are you hurt anywhere?

768
42:58.840 --> 42:59.970
Don't touch my blood.

769
43:00.030 --> 43:00.740
Don't worry about me.

770
43:00.920 --> 43:02.090
Worry about yourself.

771
43:05.360 --> 43:05.980
You can have it back.

772
43:09.120 --> 43:10.210
I'm not afraid of losing you.

773
43:13.230 --> 43:13.860
Why?

774
43:14.840 --> 43:15.900
Wherever you go,

775
43:17.000 --> 43:18.260
I can always find you.

776
43:21.710 --> 43:23.530
I've been thinking about the past few days.

777
43:24.000 --> 43:24.900
That's why I think

778
43:26.150 --> 43:27.420
you're not the bloodthirsty monster

779
43:27.480 --> 43:28.010
everyone claims.

780
43:33.060 --> 43:35.100
[Be good]

781
43:50.320 --> 43:50.900
Qi Fengyin!

782
43:53.380 --> 43:59.300
♪Life and death find no harbor in your cloudy eyes♪

783
44:00.060 --> 44:05.900
♪Words across a thousand years gently caress the abyss♪

784
44:07.300 --> 44:10.980
♪One thought binds cause and effect, who can tell right from wrong?♪

785
44:11.340 --> 44:13.940
♪Threads of love entwine the stars♪

786
44:14.220 --> 44:20.340
♪We cross paths through lifetimes, rekindling the sparks of time♪

787
44:21.460 --> 44:23.540
♪In this fleeting, complex world, good and evil♪

788
44:23.540 --> 44:27.340
♪Blur together, ensnaring you and me♪

789
44:28.340 --> 44:34.220
♪Love rides the waves, cleaving a path through this vast world...♪

790
44:34.480 --> 44:35.530
Yinhua was right.

791
44:37.630 --> 44:38.300
Qi Fengyin and I

792
44:38.760 --> 44:40.170
planned all of this together.

793
44:43.110 --> 44:44.650
I'll never let any of you

794
44:45.070 --> 44:46.460
hurt Qi Fengyin.

795
45:00.110 --> 45:01.090
I can fix

796
45:01.150 --> 45:02.090
that little flaw too.

797
45:02.480 --> 45:02.940
Really?

798
45:03.070 --> 45:04.210
Just now, were you worried

799
45:04.360 --> 45:05.460
about the mystical flower

800
45:06.230 --> 45:07.300
or about me?

801
45:10.760 --> 45:12.340
My Lord, wake up!

802
45:12.550 --> 45:13.650
It's Yamao!

803
45:14.190 --> 45:15.940
She's the woman you love most!

804
45:38.900 --> 45:42.940
♪See this world where flowers have yet to bloom♪

805
45:43.180 --> 45:46.620
♪So many longings♪

806
45:47.300 --> 45:49.380
♪Linger in the web of fate♪

807
45:49.580 --> 45:54.580
♪Then vanish like mist in a moment♪

808
45:55.500 --> 45:59.540
♪Before seas turn to fields♪

809
45:59.780 --> 46:03.220
♪Dreams scatter across the sky♪

810
46:03.900 --> 46:05.980
♪One look into each other's eyes♪

811
46:06.180 --> 46:13.580
♪And we fall in love in an instant♪

812
46:14.980 --> 46:18.660
♪When a hundred thousand blossoms have withered♪

813
46:18.900 --> 46:22.580
♪I'll still want to stay with you like this forever♪

814
46:23.220 --> 46:26.780
♪The wish we made in the long night♪

815
46:27.100 --> 46:31.260
♪Still waits to come true♪

816
46:31.500 --> 46:35.180
♪However many hardships this vast world holds♪

817
46:35.740 --> 46:39.380
♪I'll stay by your side♪

818
46:39.860 --> 46:43.460
♪Love will grace our days till the end of time♪

819
46:43.700 --> 46:51.020
♪When the dream ends, we'll have no regrets♪

820
47:04.500 --> 47:08.540
♪Before seas turn to fields♪

821
47:08.780 --> 47:12.220
♪Dreams scatter across the sky♪

822
47:12.900 --> 47:14.980
♪One look into each other's eyes♪

823
47:15.140 --> 47:22.580
♪And we fall in love in an instant♪

824
47:23.500 --> 47:27.180
♪However many hardships this vast world holds♪

825
47:27.780 --> 47:31.380
♪I'll stay by your side♪

826
47:31.900 --> 47:35.460
♪Love will grace our days till the end of time♪

827
47:35.700 --> 47:43.020
♪When the dream ends, we'll have no regrets♪
